# Version control
# .git is intentionally kept: the build stage reads it (git rev-parse) to stamp the
# commit into the diagnostics dump. It is never copied into the runtime image.

# Installed dependencies / build outputs (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/_output
**/_temp
**/_tests
**/_artifacts
**/_cache

# Runtime state
_run

# Nix results
result
result-*

# Editor / OS cruft
.direnv
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs / compose are not needed to build the image
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
